# derivation-differential's starts of core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh (BL-879 grammar).
# Every other drive is in process: run.sh loads the subject once (inproc_load) and calls dd_main through inproc_run.
# One cli cell per distinct CLI outcome (exit 1 naming a NEWLY-FAILING derivation, exit 0 with the clear, exit 2 with
# a refusal), each started as FXCELL=<id> bash "$SUBJ" in eqv() and compared byte for byte with the in-process call.
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh cli-broke
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh cli-clear
cli core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh cli-refuse
